   Ruippo, Lotta; Sekki, Sanna; Autio, Minna, Univ Helsinki, Fac Educ Sci, Dept Educ, Helsinki, Finland.
   Kylkilahti, Eliisa; Autio, Minna, Univ Helsinki, Helsinki Inst Sustainabil Sci, Fac Agr \& Forestry, Helsinki, Finland.
